WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Assembly components: printed tray, flex PCB, piezoresistive textile and bump sheet.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Seat the flex PCB in the printed tray.

3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Place the piezoresistive textile over the taxels.

4
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Seat the bump sheet so its bases align with the gaps between taxels.

5
00:00:49.000 --> 00:01:08.500
Insert the flex tail into the readout board and close the connector latch.
